<title>USA: Major states-U.S. corn, soybean intended plantings.</title>
<headline>Major states-U.S. corn, soybean intended plantings.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA 1997 major state corn and soybean planting intentions in 1,000 acres, pct of 1997/96:</p>
<p>CORN---PCT--IND'97--PLANT'96  PLANT'95</p>
<p> - Ill  102  11,200  11,000     10,200</p>
<p> - Ind  105   5,900   5,600	5,400</p>
<p> -Iowa   98  12,500  12,700     11,700</p>
<p> -Minn   97   7,300   7,500	6,700</p>
<p> -Nebr  101   8,600   8,500	8,000</p>
<p> -Ohio  131   3,800   2,900	3,300</p>
<p> -S.D.  105   4,200   4,000	2,800</p>
<p> -U.S.  102  81,416  79,487     71,245</p>
<p>SOYBEANS (Indicated 1997, Planted 1996, Pct of 1997/96):</p>
<p> -	PCT--IND'97--PLANT'96  PLANT'95</p>
<p> Ark    107   3,800   3,550	3,450</p>
<p> Ill    103  10,200   9,900	9,750</p>
